        "original_id": "2ddafea5-aed6-591a-8a57-163779b492c4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Archie Andrews, John L. Goldwater, Bob Montana, Vic Bloom, Fiona Staples\n- Companies: Archie Comics\n- Products: Archie, The Archie Show, Archie's Weird Mysteries, Archie Andrews radio series, syndicated Archie Andrews comic strip, North 40, DV8: Gods and Monsters, T.H.U.N.D.E.R. Agents, Saga\n- Topics: comic books, comic book artists\n\nFacts:\n- In 1941, John L. Goldwater, Bob Montana, and Vic Bloom created Archie Andrews.\n- Archie Andrews is the main character in an American comic book series published by Archie Comics.\n- Archie Andrews is also featured in the long-running Archie Andrews radio series, a syndicated comic strip, The Archie Show, and Archie's Weird Mysteries.\n- Archie is an ongoing comic book series that features the Archie Comics character Archie Andrews.\n- Fiona Staples is a Canadian comic book artist.\n- Fiona Staples is known for work on North 40, DV8: Gods and Monsters, T.H.U.N.D.E.R. Agents, Archie, and Saga.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
